Record storeWeightedSums for a float64 reference (TT_RELION_RECORD_SUMS, src_acc_tt/tt_sums_record.h).

Applies on top of relion5-tt.patch and relion5-estep-profile.patch. Three calls, each one branch when recording
is off: after RELION's wavg kernel, after its backprojection kernel (which is then run once more into an empty
volume, so the record holds what one particle adds), and before a particle's sums are added to wsum_model.

